## Original Content
The Chronicles of Riddick: Escape from Butcher Bay didn’t just break the licensed-game curse, it was a bona fide Game of the Year contender on Xbox that year (it was won by a little game called Halo 2 that released in November of that year).

## Summary
The Chronicles of Riddick: Escape from Butcher Bay is celebrated as one of the most underrated games ever made, breaking the licensed-game curse and earning Game of the Year contender status on Xbox before ultimately losing to Halo 2.

## Key Points
- Escape from Butcher Bay is regarded as one of the most underrated games ever made
- The game successfully broke the so-called 'licensed-game curse'
- It was a Game of the Year contender on Xbox in its release year
- Halo 2 won Game of the Year that same year
- Both titles released in November of the same year


